SY_TALK("l3EzcjhylnE",[[274,["Today we have decided to celebrate the Buddha","Jayanti, it's the day of Buddha's birth."]],[290,["In the whole","map of time, Buddha came to this earth at"]],[306,["a time when it was so important for Him to","come."]],[313,["That time, especially in India, we had two","types of people: one, who were very ritualistic,"]],[334,["trying to be extremely strict and disciplined;","and the another were the people who were"]],[355,["too much conditioned and were full of so-called","devotion to God."]],[367,["So these two types of people were occupying","the area of seekers."]],[384,["So it was necessary to neutralize these two","styles of seekings."]],[395,["Buddha and Mahavira are, in essence, supported","by Hanumana and Bhairava - that is, as you"]],[412,["know, Gabriel and Saint Michael."]],[417,["The principle that took birth is the principle","of a disciple, and this principle was born"]],[430,["much earlier as the two sons of Shri Rama."]],[438,["This principle was brought on this earth and","incarnated: one, to conquer the ego of human"]],[451,["beings; another one, to conquer the superego","of human beings."]],[459,["Buddha, when He was born, He found that there","was misery everywhere."]],[469,["And the misery, according to Him, was due","to the desires we have."]],[478,["So to be desireless is the best way to achieve","Nirvana."]],[485,["That's what He came to conclusion."]],[490,["But how to become desireless?"]],[492,["You are sitting in the sand, and if you see,","the sand doesn't get attached to anything."]],[502,["You put anything on it, it will not spoil","anything."]],[506,["You put water, it will stick on, and as soon","as you try to throw it away the whole thing"]],[515,["will disappear into thin air."]],[519,["So to develop that kind of detachment, or","to develop a life which was desireless was"]],[539,["His aim."]],[541,["And that's why I say He was a Disciple Principles."]],[545,["So, the Disciple Principle has to find out","the way and method, while the Guru Principle"]],[557,["are the people who have already found out."]],[562,["Because He has to create a way and path."]],[565,["So, He studied all kinds of books, went to","many places."]],[572,["He read Upanishadas."]],[574,["Then He saw the people who are busy with Vedas","and were doing all kinds of ritualism."]],[581,["With the rituals, they never got the Realization,","which is actually the first verse of Veda"]],[594,["is that, \"By reading the Vedas and by doing","all the rituals of the Vedas, if you do not"]],[602,["become vida, means self-realized, vida word","means \"to know\", if you don't know the Divine"]],[610,["on your central nervous system, then you are","just missing the point."]],[619,["It is all useless for you to read Vedas."]],[623,["So He went into various areas of search."]],[630,["As today we find many seekers have been going","to many people to find out the truth."]],[642,["And He was tired, very tired."]],[646,["He thought all His seeking, all His working","hard, all His efforts, everything had just"]],[656,["made Him tired."]],[658,["And He thought it was all fruitless."]],[663,["So, He was lying under a Banyan tree, and","there the Adi Shakti gave Him Realization."]],[678,["When all your searches are over - people search","in money, in power, in love, and all kinds"]],[690,["of things."]],[691,["Ultimately people start searching in various","groups, cults, gurus, all kinds of things"]],[701,["- drugs, alcohol's, whichever way are possible","they try to search."]],[707,["But when human beings try to search something,","then in their movement they either go to the"]],[713,["left or to the right."]],[717,["And He, being such an ardent seeker, and such","a truthful seeker, He could see very clearly"]],[726,["that this is not the point of going left or","right."]],[731,["But there has to be some ascent, but how to","achieve it?"]],[735,["Who is going to give Him Self-Realization?"]],[739,["All that tiredness He laid down Himself under","the tree and suddenly He got His Realization."]],[748,["When He got His Realization, He started understanding","why this problem of conditioning and ego is"]],[762,["there."]],[763,["He found out one thing: that people when they","read too much, and try to understand - through"]],[773,["ritualism - God, then they develop their ego."]],[776,["The other side, He found out, that when people","just with some desires, go on praying to God,"]],[784,["\"Give me this, give me that\", they become","mad."]],[791,["And when He realized it, then only at that","moment when He was tired, He got His Realization."]],[799,["This is exactly what is happening today in","the modern times."]],[805,["That those who were seekers have been seeking","the Divine on the left and right hand side."]],[815,["Nowadays they are jogging."]],[819,["I don't know what they're going to achieve","through jogging."]],[822,["They're jogging like mad."]],[824,["Then there are ardent Christians, ardent Muslims,","fighting the whole world for their religion,"]],[831,["for their God, for in the name of Mohammed","Sahib, in the name of Krishna, in the name"]],[838,["of everything."]],[842,["Then they think their religion is in danger."]],[847,["I mean it is not."]],[849,["Neither the prophets nor the incarnations,","nobody is in danger, not at all."]],[856,["How can they be?"]],[860,["And no religion if it is true religion can","be in danger."]],[865,["But this He only realized after His Realization."]],[870,["But His followers who came did not see the","point that ultimately it is Self-Realization"]],[879,["He is talking."]],[881,["Actually he took all the care to see that","people should get their Self-Realization first."]],[887,["Then anything else."]],[888,["First of all He said, \"You are not going to","worship Me.\""]],[893,["As you know we don't allow people to come","for My Puja unless and until they are fully"]],[904,["established in Sahaja Yoga."]],[907,["So He first said that, \"You should be fully","established in your Self-Realization, that's"]],[913,["all.\""]],[915,["He would not talk about God, because once","you start talking about God, then He saw all"]],[924,["these horrible religions coming up in the","name of God."]],[928,["When I first came to America, you will be","surprised, I did not talk of God, I did not"]],[935,["talk of bhoots, I did not talk of any religion."]],[941,["I just talked about Self-Realization."]],[945,["The reason was, I thought, if you get your","Self-Realization then you'll understand the"]],[952,["rest of it, but no use talking to you -"]],[966,["about God or about Divine because first thing","is you must have your eyes, you must have"]],[975,["the light, otherwise what's the use of talking","about these things."]],[980,["But it so happened that Buddha did not give","anybody Realization."]],[985,["So it was all right for Him to talk about","the Spirit and not about God or any religion,"]],[992,["to such an extent that people say that Buddha","was an atheist - He did not believe in God."]],[998,["No, it was a matter of His policy that He","did not want to talk about God."]],[1007,["But what I found when I came to America that","this world is full of all kinds of things."]],[1017,["Firstly the tremendous ego that they have."]],[1022,["And secondly they are so much conditioned."]],[1026,["There were so many witchcrafts and forces,","I mean openly they are saying, \"This is a"]],[1038,["witchcraft's school.\""]],[1039,["Openly."]],[1040,["Or, \"This is a satanic powers school.\""]],[1044,["All kinds, I was surprised, openly saying","like that."]],[1047,["And when I came to San Diego first, because","I came on My own, and the people who invited"]],[1055,["Me had an organization called \"parapsychology\"","- is all bhoots."]],[1062,["So they took Me round in a huge, big hall","and there were lots of people sitting down"]],[1069,["and I saw all the bhoots."]],[1071,["(Shri Mataji laughing) I said, \"Now what should","I do?"]],[1074,["Should I say the truth or not?"]],[1075,["They might start getting angry with Me.\""]],[1078,["But I said, \"Better to tell them, because","once they are lost in the bhoots, then what"]],[1085,["will I do with them?\""]],[1087,["So I told them, \"This is all wrong, this is","all bhootish, it is all nonsense, you just"]],[1090,["don't fall a prey to all these things, this","is not correct, you better get your Realization!\""]],[1098,["And see, some people did get Realization,","and some people did leave that organization."]],[1103,["Now, last time when I came I discovered in","'83 that the lady who was in charge sort of"]],[1115,["a person, has become mad and the gentleman","who was organizing all that has become bankrupt"]],[1127,["and has gone to Australia and the building","has collapsed."]],[1131,["The bhoots must have done the job."]],[1135,["It was such a problem for Me in those days","to talk against all this nonsense."]],[1145,["Then I went to some churches, they invited","Me."]],[1146,["Now, in the church suddenly I found eight","or ten bhootish people got up and started"]],[1153,["dancing."]],[1154,["I said, \"Where am I now?\""]],[1157,["(Shri Mataji laughing &amp; laughter) I am here to","tell them about the Spirit and see the condition"]],[1165,["here."]],[1166,["What am I to tell them and they ardently","believed that I was an agent of God, of course,"]],[1172,["but God meaning bhoot."]],[1175,["It was impossible to understand how far people","have gone."]],[1182,["At the same time there was an onslaught of","all the fake gurus at that time and when I"]],[1190,["said, \"You cannot pay for it\" they said, \"You","better go back."]],[1196,["We don't want you.\""]],[1197,["So I went away and then came back after nine","years."]],[1204,["So Buddha tried to talk only about Self-Realization","and not about God at all."]],[1214,["But His followers as they are always one better","than the other, tried to create a Buddhism"]],[1223,["of their own style."]],[1228,["And in this Buddhism, whatever He had told,","they did not observe it."]],[1232,["Firstly He thought if there is ritualism and","puja an all that, before Realization where"]],[1238,["will they land up?"]],[1242,["So He said, \"All right, you do not do any","puja to Me!"]],[1249,["Do not built any monument in My name!"]],[1253,["You should not worship anything!\""]],[1258,["So what did they do?"]],[1259,["They are worshipping His teeth, they are worshipping","His nails, they are worshipping His hair."]],[1267,["Now say, for example, if you get My hair and","you are not a Realized Soul, what is the difference"]],[1278,["between My hair or anybody's hair?"]],[1280,["Just the same."]],[1283,["Without Realization all this worship took","them to very bhootish area."]],[1289,["That's how we find the Buddhists who are nowhere","near Buddha."]],[1295,["Like if you go to Japan, you can't believe","they can be Buddhist."]],[1301,["They are supposed to be Buddhist - Buddha","who is the compassionate."]],[1306,["Then we have got Chinese who followed Buddhism."]],[1314,["They couldn't understand Buddhism either."]],[1317,["And we have Tibetans where we had these horrible","lamas and we had other people in Ladakh and"]],[1325,["all that."]],[1326,["They are all doing nothing else but bhoot-vidya,","prita-vidya, smashaan vidya."]],[1332,["So even His advent amounted to the same thing","as everybody's."]],[1338,["Now Buddha told three things which are very","important, which are very useful for Sahaja"]],[1348,["Yogis to follow."]],[1351,["He said, \"Buddham Sharanam Gachami."]],[1360,["- I surrender myself to the enlightened one.\""]],[1366,["Means what?"]],[1367,["I surrender myself to the one who is enlightened."]],[1372,["In this case one can say it was Buddha."]],[1376,["In your case it is your Spirit."]],[1380,["You surrender yourself to your Spirit."]],[1384,["\"Buddham Sharanam Gachami.\""]],[1385,["Buddha means the one which knows."]],[1390,["Then He says another thing, \"Dhammam Sharanam","Gachami\" means surrender yourself to the religion,"]],[1399,["which is true religion, which is the balance."]],[1403,["Now as you see, all these man-made religions","are so funny and you can't make much out of"]],[1413,["them."]],[1414,["You can't explain if these are religions or these","are Mafias."]],[1420,["The reason is, Buddha said, \"You surrender","yourselves to Dharma.\""]],[1432,["So the Buddhist thought, \"surrender to Dharma\"","means what you have to do is to become like"]],[1438,["Buddhist - means wear a dress like a Buddhist,","like Buddha used to wear."]],[1446,["You don't become by wearing that dress Buddha,","do you?"]],[1452,["Or then they thought, \"We should do something","more.\""]],[1454,["So some Buddhist got hold of a wheel, because","He talked of a wheel-of-life and all that."]],[1464,["Absolutely, I should say, very unintelligent","way of understanding Buddha."]],[1472,["And they would go on, you see, moving that","wheel like mad."]],[1476,["You can't talk to them."]],[1478,["You say, \"Now, where is that road?\""]],[1481,["\"Buddha.\""]],[1482,["(Laughter) \"How do we go there?\""]],[1486,["(Laughter) Everything has an answer."]],[1489,["So I said, \"Please answer Me.\""]],[1493,["\"This is the answer.\""]],[1495,["So what is this answer going on?"]],[1502,["Then these people thought we should find out","new methods."]],[1507,["So some of them took to again Upanishadas","and started using also from there, making"]],[1516,["jataka kathas like the stories which are very","absurd, funny stories, mysterious stories,"]],[1525,["this story, that story."]],[1528,["At the same time Hinduism took another funny","role and they had a big assault of tantrikas."]],[1541,["And when the tantrikas came in they brought","all kinds of ugly, horrible things in the"]],[1552,["- say about the sixth century it started."]],[1559,["And a complete belt starting beyond Calcutta","going towards Dwarika, complete belt got involved"]],[1572,["into tantrism."]],[1574,["So the same Buddhist later on, followed the","same tantric methods."]],[1579,["So they tried to bring in everything from","this place, that place and a mixture, so now"]],[1587,["if you ask, \"Now what's your religion?\" they","say, \"I'm Buddhist.\""]],[1594,["\"What Buddhist?\""]],[1595,["- \"Dinayan, hinayan,"]],[1597,["I'm Zen - this, that, all kinds of Buddhism is","there."]],[1602,["Is impossible to understand really where is","Buddhism there."]],[1608,["So what do these do?"]],[1609,["One will shave their hair."]],[1611,["One will shave their moustache."]],[1613,["Another one will wear this kind of a dress."]],[1616,["(Shri Mataji laughing) This is the only difference","between from one to another."]],[1620,["But the common point is that they are all","cheats, they all can deceive you, they can"]],[1627,["tell lies without feeling funny."]],[1629,["They are very sly, very cunning and suicidal."]],[1633,["They can be very violent and the only desire","they have is to kill everybody who comes across."]],[1642,["This is where Buddha's Buddhism has ended","up."]],[1650,["So now we are face to face with Buddha."]],[1656,["But what He talked about was a spontaneous","happening of Self-Realization."]],[1663,["And He said, \"You prepare yourself.\""]],[1666,["All the time He said, \"You prepare yourself","for Self-Realization and try to watch everything"]],[1672,["without desire.\""]],[1673,["This was just preparation for Sahaja Yoga","He was talking about."]],[1678,["But as you see, all the Buddhists today, if","you see them you'll be amazed that they are"]],[1693,["neither here nor there."]],[1695,["You just don't know how to place them, how","to understand them, how to make them feel"]],[1700,["what Buddha taught or Zen has taught."]],[1703,["They are not in a condition to understand","anything."]],[1707,["It's like, you see, the brain of a person","who is having all kinds of thoughts, like"]],[1717,["all the pebbles in one little pot, making","noise."]],[1722,["God knows which one is making which noise."]],[1725,["And that's why today you find here is one","Lama, who was a guru of Hitler."]],[1732,["Imagine: Hitler's guru was Lama!"]],[1736,["Now this mister Lama is going round the whole","world with his wrinkles which can be counted"]],[1741,["one by one and asking for money."]],[1745,["Why does he want money for?"]],[1746,["He is the one who ran away from Tibet, from","Lhasa."]],[1757,["And while running away he carried such a lot","of gold with him that he could not carry."]],[1761,["So half of it he dropped it in the river and","with the half of it he reached India."]],[1766,["With the half of it already he has made a","huge, big Buddha of gold, he has too much"]],[1772,["gold with him."]],[1774,["And the rest of the gold that was salvaged,","was taken to Russia - to China, where I've"]],[1783,["seen it Myself."]],[1785,["Amazed."]],[1786,["He had gold, beer mugs, what you call","them, the huge, big things, like that."]],[1794,["Real gold."]],[1795,["And such big plates of real gold for eating","food."]],[1800,["Imagine!"]],[1801,["Buddha talked of detachment, and they had","everything in gold or silver of a very expensive"]],[1810,["quality."]],[1812,["If you see their robe, clothes and all that","you'd be amazed."]],[1815,["Though they wore all those things as robes","of renunciation, but whenever they sat in"]],[1823,["their own courtyard - courts and things like","that, inside all that they wore - inside wore"]],[1832,["all those dresses which were very heavily","done with real gold, with pearls and things,"]],[1840,["because I've seen with My own eyes."]],[1846,["I was amazed."]],[1849,["So it is like somebody who says, \"Oh, I must","get detached."]],[1853,["Now I'm going to the seashore."]],[1854,["I'm going to sit there and meditate.\""]],[1858,["There he goes, and makes a compound round","himself."]],[1861,["So I ask him, \"Why have you made a compound?\", \"You","know, maybe thieves might come in.\""]],[1866,["I mean you are detached what does it matter","if a thief comes, he will take you away, so"]],[1870,["what?"]],[1871,["You are there, doesn't matter, you can go","with a thief, you can go with anyone."]],[1875,["Why are you worried about the thief?"]],[1877,["You are detached."]],[1878,["\"Oh, you see, I am also worried that there","might be pick-pockets.\""]],[1882,["\"So why are you worried about pick-pockets?\""]],[1885,["\"Because maybe I have some money with me here,","and I have my bank account and I have my other, other"]],[1892,["things with me, so I am rather worried, see,","that a thief might come.\""]],[1896,["So why do you talk of detachment?"]],[1900,["Why do you talk of sanyasa?"]],[1902,["So this kind of a nonsensical sanyasa started","after Buddha died, which was so very shocking."]],[1912,["This led people to think that you can wear","any time an orange dress and then you are"]],[1921,["a sanyasi."]],[1922,["If you wear an orange dress you become Buddha,","and you become a detached personality."]],[1926,["Now you can announce to the whole world that,","\"I'm a detached personality\" and what is your"]],[1933,["background?"]],[1934,["\"Nothing, I just was born out of this Mother","Earth and I'm sitting here nicely like Buddha.\""]],[1940,["So people stupidly start giving them money."]],[1944,["So they get the money."]],[1946,["But actually, the background is that the fellow","might have come out of the jail in India for"]],[1951,["burglary or something like that, and now sitting","down here as Buddha."]],[1958,["How will you make out?"]],[1960,["\"Buddham Sharanam Gachami.\""]],[1966,["So what we have to do is to establish ourselves","in Buddha."]],[1972,["That is to establish within ourselves in our","Spirit."]],[1976,["Unless and until we are established in our","Spirit, we cannot understand the intricacies"]],[1985,["of all the ignorance that we have around."]],[1991,["So the best way to understand Sahaja Yoga","is to establish yourself in the Spirit."]],[1998,["But those who are not intelligent, those who","are stupid, those who are selfish and greedy"]],[2006,["do not see this point."]],[2010,["And they do not like it if a leader tells","them that, \"You must establish in Sahaja Yoga,"]],[2017,["that you should have your Spirit manifested.\""]],[2020,["They don't want to listen to it."]],[2022,["They want to be in the group of Sahaja Yogis","because they don't want to be lonely."]],[2028,["They would like to sing songs, music, everything","in Sahaja Yoga because they want somewhere"]],[2037,["to fit in, because they want an identity,","they call themselves Sahaja Yogis."]],[2043,["But this identity is a false identity."]],[2048,["You have to be identified with your Spirit."]],[2053,["That is the part is, \"Buddham Sharanam Gachami.\""]],[2058,["The second is, \"Dhammam Sharanam Gachami.\""]],[2062,["What is \"Dhammam\", is Dharma."]],[2065,["What is our Dharma, is Vishwa Nirmala Dharma."]],[2069,["That means now we have become universal beings."]],[2073,["We are no more Indians, no more Africans,","no more English, no more French."]],[2082,["We all have become now Sahaja Yogis who are","the citizens of the Kingdom of God."]],[2097,["We have no other identification."]],[2100,["This is our Dharma."]],[2103,["We are now leading a universal life."]],[2110,["But Sahaja Yogis are not like that."]],[2117,["Still, so many of them still identify themselves","with some localized stuff."]],[2124,["Now when we think of universality we have","to understand, that it's not only the religion"]],[2134,["or a country that separates us, but also a","kind of a quality."]],[2140,["For example, if there are people who are Rajo-gunis","who are very active, right-sided people, they'll"]],[2148,["combine together."]],[2149,["They may fight later but they combine."]],[2151,["Then the people who are left-sided will combine","together, but both of these should cling onto"]],[2160,["those who are trying to ascend, who are in","the center."]],[2168,["And there where we fail very much."]],[2172,["Our associations and our understandings of","each other is deluded by our ignorance and"]],[2184,["we cannot understand who is for our ascent","and who is for our benevolence."]],[2197,["This happens with us in so many ways."]],[2201,["We are universal beings and our culture is","\"Sahaja Culture.\""]],[2208,["We have given up all our nonsensical cultures."]],[2211,["In every religion, in every country we have","seen the nonsense of our culture, so we believe"]],[2219,["in the spontaneous culture of Sahaja Yoga."]],[2223,["So we are universal beings."]],[2226,["And in this state of being universal being","you have to develop your collective consciousness."]],[2235,["As first one is for individual, \"Buddham Sharanam","Gacchami\" - I surrender myself to Buddha."]],[2247,["The second one is the one, I surrender myself","to the collective - in the sense, into the"]],[2254,["Dharma, the essence of the collective."]],[2258,["Now what is the essence of our collective?"]],[2261,["What binds us together is Vishwa Nirmala Dharma,","the Pure Religion of the Universe."]],[2268,["So once you understand that this is the thing","that binds you to each other, you must understand"]],[2276,["how important it is to keep to Vishwa Nirmala","Dharma."]],[2282,["In so many ways I have been able to tell you","what is Vishwa Nirmala Dharma."]],[2289,["So we have to understand the full content","of the Dharma that we are following and also"]],[2301,["to reflect it back to see, \"Are we really","following this religion?\""]],[2307,["But in falsehood I have seen like somebody's","a Christian."]],[2311,["Every Sunday he'll get up, dress up nicely,","go to the church, get up three times, four"]],[2318,["times, sing songs, this thing, do everything,","pay the money to the priest, pay to the church,"]],[2323,["pay to that, and then he thinks he has done","the job."]],[2332,["Very religiously he'll go and confess."]],[2335,["Muslims, very religiously will do some things","which we cannot really understand."]],[2340,["As in Spain I was told that people try","to crucify themselves, as a drama of course,"]],[2347,["but they do it just to protect Christianity","I think, and to crucify - God knows what!"]],[2356,["Then there are people in India who are following","Hinduism and the first principle, the basic"]],[2364,["principle of Hinduism, that there is Spirit","in everyone."]],[2368,["So how can you have caste and subcaste and this and that?"]],[2373,["If everybody has the Spirit you can't have","caste, subcaste."]],[2377,["You cannot have division like that."]],[2381,["So what we find in every religion, there are","problematic things but once you come to this"]],[2388,["pure religion, then you see the essence of","it and the essence of it is that, that we"]],[2395,["are all Spirit and we are all related to each","other, we are part and parcel of the whole."]],[2401,["So you go to the collective."]],[2403,["So at the end He said, \"Sangham Sharanam Gachami.\""]],[2408,["This is the very important point also."]],[2412,["It's the most important thing is this \"Sangham","Sharanam Gachami.\""]],[2420,["For example, we say that you surrender yourself","to collectivity."]],[2427,["What does that mean?"]],[2428,["What does that entail (it is)?"]],[2430,["As I was talking to your leaders here, I said,","\"All of you should form one collective unit,"]],[2440,["a 'Sangham'.\""]],[2442,["All the leaders have to know that they love","Mother from their heart, and they should never"]],[2449,["try to cut each other because somebody's trying","to tell them against them."]],[2461,["They should have love for each other."]],[2464,["For example there's one Mr. X, who's a leader."]],[2465,["Now a negative force incarnates and comes","and tells the leader that, \"See the other"]],[2475,["leader is my supporter.\""]],[2476,["So this fellow has a bad feeling, the another","leader has another bad feeling."]],[2483,["This is going against \"Sangha.\""]],[2484,["First the Sangha of the collectivity of the","leaders has to be fully appreciated."]],[2491,["I enjoy the way when all these leaders meet","and beat each other nicely and enjoy each"]],[2497,["other, pull each other's legs and love each","other and patronize the younger ones and look"]],[2506,["after."]],[2507,["That's the beginning of Sangha."]],[2508,["If the leaders are not in Sangha, what other","Sangha we can form?"]],[2513,["So the first is the Sangha of the leaders","is there."]],[2516,["All those who try to break that Sangha must","know that they are negative people and they"]],[2522,["are going to stab us."]],[2525,["Anybody who tries that, you should be very","careful."]],[2529,["The second Sangha, collectivity, is among","the Sahaja Yogis."]],[2535,["Now we are not, as I told you, Indians, or","we are not English or Americans or anything,"]],[2543,["so we should not form groups."]],[2546,["What you'll find always, if there are five","Americans they'll stick on to each other as"]],[2552,["if they have been glued, and they can't move","away from each other."]],[2556,["All of them will be together."]],[2558,["If there are Indians, they will stick on together."]],[2563,["If there are other kinds, they'll all stick","on together."]],[2568,["Now we are no more that."]],[2571,["It's finished!"]],[2572,["So what is there to glue to each other?"]],[2574,["But it happens."]],[2576,["We always glue to each other."]],[2578,["I don't know why."]],[2580,["What is the need to do that?"]],[2582,["And very commonly we see that in India people","are behaving in a very funny manner."]],[2590,["Last year I did not know, but people told","Me that some group came and they were all"]],[2596,["the time saying, \"We are a great nation, we","are a great nation.\""]],[2604,["They are not Sahaja Yogis."]],[2608,["Our nation is Kingdom of God and our King","is God Almighty and we have no other King"]],[2618,["and no other nation."]],[2621,["If you cannot transcend those barriers of","stupid limitations you cannot become Sahaja"]],[2632,["Yogis."]],[2633,["But this is in a very gross way."]],[2636,["But in a very subtle way, I see a lady who","is catching or who has badha will immediately"]],[2646,["crawl into another one - somehow."]],[2648,["She may belong to any country, doesn't matter."]],[2651,["You see, a bhootish woman, say, coming from","India, will crawl up to another one in Australia."]],[2661,["Straight forward, march!"]],[2663,["Just start watching, \"Where is she going?"]],[2667,["Oh God, that's it!\""]],[2669,["So the bhoots are very collective, a big fraternity,","great fraternity."]],[2675,["If they see somebody who is possessed, this","bhootish person will immediately go to her."]],[2681,["It is very surprising that the bhoots are","so collective."]],[2688,["Apart from that, they know Me very well."]],[2692,["They understand Me very well."]],[2694,["Even a little child if he is caught up will","start crying before Me, shaking before Me,"]],[2701,["not coming before Me."]],[2703,["But when they are realized, they don't understand","and moreover they don't understand a simple"]],[2710,["principle that we are now possessed by our","own Spirit and we are one."]],[2715,["So they should stick on more to the person","who is a spiritually evolved personality."]],[2727,["But instead of that, for them some \"third-rater\"","something is much more important than a person"]],[2735,["who is such a highly developed person."]],[2739,["This is where we fail in our collective."]],[2742,["A very subtle method of these negative people."]],[2747,["Just finding out how to form a big formidable","group to attack."]],[2751,["With that you lose your vibrations."]],[2757,["Once you lose your vibrations then you say,","\"Oh, this is too much."]],[2764,["We must have compassion."]],[2766,["We must have love."]],[2768,["After all we are all Sahaja Yogis.\""]],[2772,["So it's the compassion and love of bhoots","among themselves."]],[2777,["They are talking of compassion to each other."]],[2782,["Even with Me they said, \"Mother, you have","to be kind.\""]],[2788,["I said, \"Are you more compassionate than Me","that you are teaching Me?\""]],[2795,["If I'm saying anything to this lady taking","all My breath and all My energy on her, then"]],[2805,["I'm doing it for her benevolence and it's","My compassion that is [why/working], but what you"]],[2810,["are doing is not for the benevolence but for","the destruction of that person."]],[2818,["So no use supporting someone who is negative."]],[2824,["Many negative persons who have been asked","to get out of Sahaja Yoga sometimes create"]],[2830,["this problem of coming, \"Oh Mother, you know,","I'm so good, but they tortured me, they troubled"]],[2837,["me so much.\""]],[2838,["Now I'm seeing a bhoot in the person."]],[2840,["I can clearly see."]],[2842,["I can see the negativity, but if you do not","see, you will immediately start taking sides,"]],[2849,["\"Oh God, look at this, poor thing is tortured.\""]],[2854,["You lose your vibrations, you won't be able","to find out!"]],[2860,["So don't come under the spell of these murmuring","souls, as Christ has called."]],[2865,["He said, \"Murmuring souls are the greatest","danger.\""]],[2870,["That I've seen in Sahaja Yoga."]],[2872,["Those who murmur, talk at the back, go on","complaining are the greatest danger to Sahaja"]],[2880,["Yoga and ultimately to themselves."]],[2883,["Because they'll be found out."]],[2886,["So this is the another situation into which","we are not collective and when we are collective,"]],[2896,["we are collective for something which is not","ascending force."]],[2904,["It is something surprising how we see people","in this world are inviting their destruction"]],[2917,["and we too, in a way, when we don't understand","what is collectivity, try to destroy our body"]],[2927,["of Sahaja Yoga."]],[2932,["Today I'm telling you this because all these","things must be stopped now on the day of Buddha's"]],[2939,["birth."]],[2940,["Buddha is the one who is in charge of your","ego."]],[2947,["If you go beyond Buddha and start showing","off too much, then He pushes your ego into"]],[2955,["your left Vishuddhi."]],[2957,["So you develop your left Vishuddhi and when","you develop your left Vishuddhi, what happens?"]],[2963,["That you start feeling guilty, meaning you","do not want to face the situation at all,"]],[2968,["but you say \"Oh, I'm very guilty."]],[2971,["I've killed you, all right, I've killed you,","I'm feeling guilty.\""]],[2976,["We never face the situation."]],[2978,["This is the ego which goes into the left and","creates this problem of left Vishuddhi."]],[2984,["It's not by any chance your style of bearing","up things, or you are being suppressed."]],[2991,["But no, you have been oppressing others, you","have been egoistical and it has been so much"]],[3003,["that it has gone into the left Vishuddhi."]],[3011,["So you are trying to justify."]],[3013,["Now I would suggest that if you really want","to understand Sahaja Yoga, first try to understand"]],[3021,["yourself."]],[3023,["Then you see, \"Where is my mind going now?\""]],[3029,["Some ladies who are used to, say gossip, they","come to Sahaja Yoga."]],[3034,["They are all right, but sometimes that thing","comes, \"Let's go and gossip about this lady\"."]],[3041,["They'll just get up, walk on to another one who","must have been gossiped in last life, maybe."]],[3047,["So go and talk to that person and tell something","against that person."]],[3053,["(Shri Mataji laughing) Then they find out","another gossiper or they get another gossiper."]],[3061,["Now, what I find is three great Sahaja Yoginis","are sitting and gossiping there."]],[3065,["I say, \"What are you talking?\""]],[3066,["\"Oh, no Mother, we were discussing Sahaja","Yoga.\""]],[3071,["I said, \"Really?\""]],[3073,["(Laughter) Discussing Sahaja Yogis is never","discussion on Sahaja Yoga."]],[3083,["If you are discussing people you are not discussing","Sahaja Yoga."]],[3089,["Discussing Sahaja Yoga has nothing to do with","human beings or with Realized souls."]],[3097,["Thank God, you don't discuss Me, because I","must be making lots of mistakes."]],[3106,["In relation to your culture, in relation to","your styles, in relation to the human style."]],[3113,["For example, you have to say, \"Thank you\"","ten times."]],[3116,["I might be saying it only three times or four","times."]],[3120,["Or you have to say, \"Sorry, sorry, sorry,","sorry.\""]],[3123,["On the telephone even now, I never say sorry,","I say, \"I beg your pardon?\""]],[3128,["But you see, people will say, \"Sorry, sorry,","sorry.\""]],[3131,["I start thinking, \"Am I in the wrong or they","are in the wrong?\""]],[3137,["(Laughter)"]],[3138,["So when we start discussing others, what we","really do is to confront or to face someone"]],[3151,["with your own limitations."]],[3153,["And we start thinking, \"He should have done","like this, he should have ...\" What about"]],[3162,["you?"]],[3163,["So best is, you discuss yourself with yourself","and you discuss Sahaja Yoga with others."]],[3171,["This is the best way to get rid of one of","the greatest enemies of collectivity, is gossip."]],[3176,["Is a human nature, you know, I think, to gossip."]],[3184,["Another horrible thing we have, which Buddha","has tried to control, is a very subtle type"]],[3194,["of aggressiveness."]],[3196,["That one of the games I play is of making","somebody a leader."]],[3202,["It's a game, please remember."]],[3203,["Even if I tell you, \"I'm Mahamaya\", you forget","it."]],[3207,["Even if I tell you, \"I'm playing a game\",","still you forget it."]],[3211,["You become so seriously leaders, you see."]],[3214,["It's nothing to feel that you are leaders,","there's nothing like leaders, there's nothing"]],[3218,["like that in Sahaja Yoga."]],[3220,["But then I praise some."]],[3223,["Now I had a mind to praise people today for","yesterday's program."]],[3230,["The way it was arranged, the way it was done","beautifully, so many people came, is remarkable."]],[3235,["But then I was thinking, \"Should I say or","not?\""]],[3240,["(Laughter) If I say, next time, God knows","what I will see."]],[3248,["(Laughter) So encouraging like this, will","it help or not?"]],[3257,["So I've been still discreet about it."]],[3260,["Of course, I must say, yesterday's program","was very remarkable and we must really give"]],[3266,["a hand to Dave and to the leader, our Karan."]],[3275,["(Applause)"]],[3277,["Despite all stupid opposition and nonsense,","they have shown how they have brought in so"]],[3296,["many people to Sahaja Yoga and how with complete","concentration they have been able to establish"]],[3304,["so many in Sahaja Yoga."]],[3310,["So it is for you to learn from it, that despite","all problems and anything, without feeling"]],[3318,["bad about it, just see that you move like","a big elephant towards giving Realization"]],[3328,["to others, creating more Sahaja Yogis and","more Sahaja Yogis in America."]],[3339,["Those who had this aim in life that we have","to give Realization to people, we have to"]],[3346,["achieve establishment of Sahaja Yoga, they","never will have any problems of any kind."]],[3357,["So never bring down yourself to the level","where you think that, \"See, the food was not"]],[3364,["good, that was not good, this one was not","good, this fellow was torturing, that fellow"]],[3370,["was doing this.\""]],[3372,["Nothing."]],[3373,["This is not going to help you, help anyone."]],[3376,["Not going to give you any marks, as they say."]],[3380,["After all if you have to enter into the Kingdom","of God, one has to know that you have to have"]],[3386,["certain marks."]],[3387,["Otherwise God will say, \"You failed\", (Laughter)","and you'll be surprised why the entrance is"]],[3393,["not allowed."]],[3395,["You are thinking you are so intelligent, so","great, you see, how much gossip you have created,"]],[3401,["how much problems you have created, how many","leaders you have pulled down, how much you"]],[3406,["have befooled Mother and all that."]],[3409,["(Laughter) And there suddenly you find, \"I've","failed."]],[3413,["(Laughter) What has happened?\""]],[3416,["So don't deceive your Self."]],[3420,["Self is the Spirit."]],[3423,["Don't deceive your Self."]],[3426,["If you deceive yourself, ultimately you will","be deceived and despite the fact you have"]],[3432,["been Sahaja Yogis, you have been to My Puja,","you have been here and you have been certified"]],[3437,["as Sahaja Yogis, there's light on your head,","still they will say, \"Take another life,"]],[3442,["and then come back."]],[3443,["Take another as, you see, failed, you have","to go through one year more."]],[3453,["Try another one.\""]],[3455,["(Laughter)"]],[3456,["So the easiest way to be a good Sahaja Yogi,","not to deceive your Self."]],[3462,["Watch yourself!"]],[3463,["Where is this mind going?"]],[3468,["What am I thinking?"]],[3469,["What is my mind working now?"]],[3471,["Can I, this man is coming, can I give him","Realization?"]],[3479,["Should I start talking to him about Sahaja Yoga?"]],[3481,["Sitting in the train, you watch a person."]],[3484,["\"Ah, this is all right!"]],[3487,["Let's manage this fellow.\""]],[3490,["All the time you have to catch human beings","like fishes are caught."]],[3497,["I've taught you how to do it."]],[3502,["To go on catching them, one by one, and create","a greater collectivity."]],[3506,["If your attention is on that, then I will","say, \"You have acted like Buddha\", because"]],[3520,["Buddha just did that."]],[3523,["From everywhere He collected people, told","them to follow a path of detachment and He"]],[3529,["asked them to wear clothes and things which","are for detachment."]],[3535,["And He asked that you should detach yourself","from your families, everything."]],[3541,["This, all this, He did for one thing, that","they should be prepared for today's life."]],[3548,["That they've done all these things, but we","don't want you to wear orange dresses, we"]],[3555,["don't want you to do all these wrong things,","which are not needed today."]],[3563,["They were all right in those days, but today","they are wrong because they are not needed."]],[3569,["When it is not needed, why should you carry","on your head?"]],[3575,["Like the other day, I saw somebody carrying","a big boat on his head."]],[3579,["I said, \"What are you doing?\""]],[3581,["He said, \"I'm carrying the boat.\""]],[3582,["\"For what?"]],[3583,["Why are you carrying the boat?\""]],[3586,["Said, \"You see, I know there is no need to","carry the boat here because there is no sea,"]],[3592,["no water, nothing, but I'm just carrying.\""]],[3595,["(Laughter) \"But why are you carrying this","load upon your head?\""]],[3601,["\"Ah, because I'm carrying, you know.\""]],[3608,["(Laughter)"]],[3609,["That is how we are."]],[3611,["We are carrying on with things which are not","needed."]],[3615,["Like, \"Mother, now I've been doing Hatha Yoga,","should I do some Hatha Yoga?\""]],[3620,["\"But why do you want to do it?"]],[3624,["There is no need for you.\""]],[3625,["\"No, no, Mother, but I've been doing it.\""]],[3631,["(Laughter) \"So do it now, what to do?\""]],[3634,["It's as stupid as this carrying a boat on","your head, that whatever is not needed unnecessarily"]],[3641,["wasting your time."]],[3643,["\"I'm used to this, Mother, I used to do this,","so I must do it.\""]],[3651,["Everything is made very easy for you in Sahaja","Yoga."]],[3655,["Very simple."]],[3656,["You don't have to starve, you don't have to","fast, you don't have to become vegetarians,"]],[3662,["you don't have to go and sit in the sun or","meditate on Himalayas."]],[3668,["Nothing of the kind."]],[3669,["Comfortably you can sit down wherever you","like and you can meditate."]],[3674,["Everything made easy."]],[3678,["And once you've found out your Spirit, you","can enjoy everything that's beautiful."]],[3685,["Now on the whole, maybe for some people this","is really too much."]],[3691,["In a Sahara Desert you are sitting, everything","blowing on your head."]],[3696,["\"What is this?"]],[3697,["How can we live here?"]],[3698,["Such a rough life!\""]],[3702,["But you don't feel that way, because you have","the comfort of the Spirit within you."]],[3707,["It's the comfort of the Spirit."]],[3710,["And for the comfort of Spirit you don't need","anything, that's what you have."]],[3717,["So do not carry on with nonsensical things."]],[3721,["Because Buddha went round and round."]],[3723,["As we came today to this program, I was just","thinking like Buddha."]],[3728,["Going from this end, again coming from this","end, then I couldn't find it, then that end,"]],[3733,["then coming this way."]],[3733,["Ultimately we reached here, they said it's blocked!"]],[3735,["I said, \"Give him a bandhan.\""]],[3741,["Finished, open!"]],[3743,["So this was blocked, that was blocked, go","this way, that way."]],[3746,["All right, it was blocked for Him."]],[3748,["So He went round and round."]],[3751,["But it's not blocked for you."]],[3752,["Why do you want to go round and round again?"]],[3755,["But that is what today everybody wants to","do the same way."]],[3757,["\"We must sacrifice, we must give up this,","we must do that.\""]],[3761,["What are you going to sacrifice?"]],[3762,["What is there to sacrifice?"]],[3766,["I would like to know in Sahaja Yoga."]],[3776,["Of course, mostly people sacrifice their brains,","I think."]],[3784,["(Laughter) When nothing is to be sacrificed,","why do you want to become a goat of sacrifice?"]],[3792,["So from Buddha's life, you don't have to learn","that He went in the jungles and He went, He"]],[3801,["did this and He did also renunciation."]],[3805,["He gave up his wife."]],[3808,["No!"]],[3809,["That's not needed now, that's over."]],[3816,["This is where we fail and we cannot explain","to people that those who say, \"But we must"]],[3824,["have renunciation.\""]],[3825,["Renunciation we have from within, like the","sand, as I told you."]],[3831,["Detachment we have from within."]],[3834,["But this is compassion, pure compassion is","the most detached thing."]],[3843,["Is the most detached thing is the pure compassion,","or anything pure is pure because it is detached."]],[3854,["It's a proper mathematics."]],[3858,["Anything that is pure has to be detached."]],[3860,["If it is attached it is contaminated."]],[3865,["See the logic."]],[3866,["Absolute mathematics is there."]],[3871,["If you have pure love then you are detached."]],[3874,["Now supposing you love Mother - all right,","take that."]],[3878,["Now you have say, pure love for Me, then you","won't get angry if I don't come to your house."]],[3887,["You won't feel disappointed if I can't sit","in your car."]],[3891,["You won't feel unhappy because I could not","touch your sari."]],[3896,["Because, \"I just love Mother, finished.\""]],[3898,["It ends up there."]],[3901,["Just pure love."]],[3904,["Of course, I know these weaknesses, so I try","to please you, all right, all right."]],[3909,["But actually, if you really love Me, \"It's","all right, I love Her, and She loves me, finished."]],[3916,["Whether She comes to my house or not, whether","She gives me a present or not, whether She"]],[3922,["pats me or not, whether I can see Her or not,","whether I can meet Her or not."]],[3928,["Makes no difference, I love Her.\""]],[3931,["That's the purity of love."]],[3932,["Where there's no expectation of any kind,","except that I love and that love is the ocean"]],[3939,["of enjoyment and the ocean of bliss, finished."]],[3946,["Is the easiest thing to do, is to love."]],[3952,["Just love."]],[3957,["How your heart increases like an ocean - I","just love."]],[3965,["The sea is not attached to any shore."]],[3968,["When it has to come, it comes out, when it","has to go back, it goes back."]],[3974,["When it has to give water for the rain, it","gives."]],[3977,["The water goes as the clouds are formed, then","the water falls as rain, again it comes back"]],[3983,["to the sea."]],[3985,["It doesn't stop anywhere."]],[3989,["In the same way, if we just think, \"Is the feeling","I have that I love Mother."]],[3998,["What a feeling it is.\""]],[3999,["That should be the end of everything, absolutely."]],[4008,["I feel the same way; otherwise I would be","feeling every day guilty, \"Oh, I didn't smile"]],[4015,["at that, I didn't give a present to this one."]],[4018,["I should have brought something special for","that person."]],[4022,["I was late for the program.\""]],[4024,["(Laughter) But I","don't feel guilty because it's all managed."]],[4035,["If I had come earlier, all these hecklers","would have been there to trouble us."]],[4041,["So all the horrible people disappeared and","we had the right people."]],[4044,["Then I set down through."]],[4047,["I didn't say, \"I'm going back.\""]],[4050,["There is no need to be nervous."]],[4051,["If Mother is late, there must be some plan."]],[4056,["If She is early, there must be some plan."]],[4059,["If She's going by this plane and not by the","other, there must be some plan."]],[4064,["Not to doubt it."]],[4067,["If She's doing something, must be some plan."]],[4069,["You know, Mother has Her own plans."]],[4072,["Is a nice idea to think like that."]],[4075,["\"She has Her own plans, you know.\""]],[4080,["Once you start feeling that way, such security","and such beautiful peace will spread in your"]],[4088,["being."]],[4089,["And you will be quite satisfied."]],[4092,["Now, everybody brings food for Me, look at","that."]],[4096,["I mean, when I see that I get a fright, baba."]],[4102,["(Laughter) I mean, look at that!"]],[4107,["I'm supposed to taste it, but even tasting","will be so much."]],[4115,["(Laughter) But I've to eat, you know, because","if I don't touch one of them, then they will"]],[4123,["think, \"Why didn't Mother touch?"]],[4125,["Must be something wrong.\""]],[4126,["(Laughter) This is a very big problem for","Me, to keep you happy and to assure you."]],[4138,["But I assure you that I love you all very","much!!"]],[4142,["Whether you bring food for Me, or flowers","for Me or anything."]],[4147,["Does not matter."]],[4149,["When I'm leaving Bogota, My heart is wrenching","out, I've seen the wrench of My heart, I've"]],[4157,["seen."]],[4158,["Because I'm leaving all the new babes there,","that's all."]],[4162,["Then I just don't want to face, I mean, the","thing, I feel, \"Oh God, just see I'm leaving"]],[4169,["them.\""]],[4170,["But, because I love them."]],[4174,["So I see, because I love them I feel it, so","it's all right, even this pain is all right, because"]],[4182,["I love them."]],[4184,["I enjoy that pain because I love them."]],[4188,["And then I come here and see all of you standing","at the airport."]],[4192,["Whole thing is fulfilled again."]],[4195,["Just not because you have come - because I","have come to love you."]],[4204,["All this is such a beautiful rapport and such","a beautiful feeling."]],[4210,["I want you all to enjoy this and not petty","things and small things which spoil your joy."]],[4216,["These are all joy killers and that's why the","greatest joy killer is the ego nonsensical,"]],[4223,["which tells you, \"Oh, why didn't Mother do","this or do that?\""]],[4228,["It's the ego part of it."]],[4230,["That's why we have to think of Buddha and","celebrate his Jayanti within ourselves to"]],[4235,["establish Him to say that, \"This ego cannot","take away our joy.\""]],[4245,["Anywhere such idea just comes into your head","tell them, \"Now Mister ego, I know you very"]],[4251,["well!\""]],[4252,["(Laughter) In the light of Buddha you can","see your ego very clearly."]],[4258,["And He's the killer of your ego, He's the","one who finishes off your ego."]],[4262,["So today we have to pray for the whole of","America which is really suffering from this"]],[4271,["nonsensical, mythical ego, which is being","exploited by everyone."]],[4275,["People are befooling them, the media is befooling,","all the doctors are befooling, all the psychologists"]],[4281,["are befooling, all the governments are befooling."]],[4285,["I mean, I don't know, everybody is befooled,","because they've got ego."]],[4289,["If they had no ego, they could not have been","befooled."]],[4291,["All these advertisements and all this hocus-pocus","that's going on, is because human beings have"]],[4300,["ego and they can't see it."]],[4304,["So we have to say, \"Mother, please take away","this curse of ego from Americans and America.\""]],[4312,["That's why it is nice today we have this Buddha","Puja."]],[4317,["May God bless you!"]]]);
